{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;<strong>Exorcism Agency</strong>&quot;is an innovative game inspired by Chinese and Japanese urban legends and ghost culture, integrating match-three mechanics, roguelike card gameplay, and ghost storytelling adventures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Match-Three + Roguelike Cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exorcism Agency</strong> merges classic Zuma match-three elements with roguelike card gameplay, creating a unique creative experience.Players must analyze their cards to devise optimal strategies and place them in the correct spiritual positions to ensure all spirits are eliminated.While eliminating spirits one by one may work in regular exorcism activities, as ghosts surge in, failing to exploit the 'gaps' between spirits for a continuous elimination will surely turn you into 'food' for them.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3408380?t=1753364890","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3408380?t=1753364890","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408380/4ec3987c3bc48ae441fac51f6d216dcdcfd19126/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753364890","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408380/4ec3987c3bc48ae441fac51f6d216dcdcfd19126/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753364890","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Regarding depictions of suicide: Some characters' backstories include descriptions of suicide.\r\n\r\nRegarding depictions of fear: The overall setting features a dark and eerie atmosphere, accompanied by horror elements and similarly themed music.\r\n\r\nRegarding revealing clothing: Some outfits may be revealing, and there will also be some costumes with erotic elements.\r\n\r\nRegarding depictions of blood, some characters will bleed upon defeat to enhance the sense of horror."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;<strong>Exorcism Agency</strong>&quot;is an innovative game inspired by Chinese and Japanese urban legends and ghost culture, integrating match-three mechanics, roguelike card gameplay, and ghost storytelling adventures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Match-Three + Roguelike Cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exorcism Agency</strong> merges classic Zuma match-three elements with roguelike card gameplay, creating a unique creative experience.Players must analyze their cards to devise optimal strategies and place them in the correct spiritual positions to ensure all spirits are eliminated.While eliminating spirits one by one may work in regular exorcism activities, as ghosts surge in, failing to exploit the 'gaps' between spirits for a continuous elimination will surely turn you into 'food' for them.</p>","developers":["YINGGUO GAME"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408380/fe473f8dca6ded7065d503b331f3d2a09a23dda5/header.jpg?t=1753364890","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257172460,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172460/movie480.mp4?t=1753229537","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172460/movie_max.mp4?t=1753229537"},"name":"pv","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257172460/d0b926ce72f1d2f0b61ace5db2a7333ddf51db3b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753229537","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172460/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1753229537","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172460/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1753229537"}}],"name":"\u9664\u7075\u4e8b\u52a1\u6240","package_groups"